WEBVTT

00:00:01.480 --> 00:00:05.480
<i>After seeing Haruto in pain,
 Kaito began to mess up his own Dueling.</i>

00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:09.400
<i>And we're being pushed back by IV and III's tactics.</i>

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.610
Go, Masshu Macu!

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.280
Infinity Cannon!

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.830
It's over, Kaito.

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:20.700
Take 3000 damage!

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:27.130
Trap, activate! Braveheart!

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:37.890
By halving my own Life, I can negate the activation of a Monster Effect this turn!

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.180
What?

00:00:46.190 --> 00:00:46.850
Yuma!

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.570
The loser just had to make things complicated...

00:00:52.570 --> 00:00:55.110
<i>He sacrificed himself again...</i>

00:00:57.110 --> 00:00:59.240
You okay, Astral?

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:02.370
There's no helping you.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:04.330
This is your Dueling, after all.

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:05.580
I'm used to it.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.590
Why did you...?

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:11.840
I told you!

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:14.470
I said I'd bring you to Haruto!

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:16.470
Stay out of it!

00:01:17.220 --> 00:01:20.140
I set one card and end my turn!

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:24.020
Geez! He could at least thank Yuma!

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:27.520
Please forgive him. Kaito-<i>sama</i>'s desperate!

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:46.750
<i>Here.</i>

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:50.210
<i>That's amazing, Brother!</i>

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.960
<i>These are... Haruto's memories.</i>

00:01:56.590 --> 00:01:58.050
<i>Sure is pretty!</i>

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:05.100
<i>I know we just captured it and all, but can we let it go?</i>

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:05.850
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:05.850 --> 00:02:10.770
<i>I mean, it's pitiful to spend your entire life in a cage.</i>

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:14.070
<i>Haruto-</i>sama<i>...!</i>

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:16.820
<i>You sure are kind.</i>

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:29.500
I will steal all of your memories from you!

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:36.110
<i>As I get closer, I stretch my hand out</i>

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:39.160
<i>towards that shining light leading towards tomorrow</i>

00:02:39.330 --> 00:02:46.420
<i>I dream of a world that expands from my feet.</i>

00:02:50.170 --> 00:02:55.680
<i>I haven't a clue of where things like dreams and hopes are at.</i>

00:02:55.680 --> 00:03:00.180
<i>Even if I run looking for it, I still can't seem to find it.</i>

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:06.640
<i>I wonder if I have fallen into a gap of truth and lies.</i>

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:11.440
<i>Even so, our grand tale has yet to begin.</i>

00:03:11.860 --> 00:03:17.110
<i>Let's move on towards tomorrow, 
even if our road begins to fall apart.</i>

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:22.370
<i>I will jump forward, before all my
 strength completely drains.</i>

00:03:22.790 --> 00:03:25.250
<i>The closer I get, the further it becomes,</i>

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:28.540
<i>that truth that I must seize.</i>

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:33.710
<i>It's to find hope that we desire from a future unseen.</i>

00:03:33.710 --> 00:03:36.300
<i>With a heart stronger than anyone else,</i>

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:39.470
<i>I'll learn to keep running up.</i>

00:03:39.800 --> 00:03:45.020
<i>With the strength to win any battle, 
despite just how weak I am,</i>

00:03:45.520 --> 00:03:47.520
<i>My purpose is to find,</i>

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:50.520
<i>with these invaluable friends of mine,</i>

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:57.320
<i>The future of the world expanding
 from my feet with my own eyes.</i>

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:11.730
Go on and draw your card!

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:14.100
"Number 43: The Miraculous Overlay,
 Neo Galaxy Eyes Photon Dragon!"

00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:13.980
Heh, don't be in such a hurry.

00:04:15.190 --> 00:04:16.900
You sure are looking like a sorrowful mess.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.900
Damn you IV!

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:20.900
That really was too much.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:22.610
Too much!?

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:27.120
Have you forgotten the pain we've been through!?

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.580
Brother...

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:32.080
Just focus on your job!

00:04:33.370 --> 00:04:35.790
My turn! Draw!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:40.630
I activate the Continuous Magic called OOPArt Pyramid Eye Tablet!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:47.850
This card increases the Attack Power of OOPArt Monsters on my field by 800 points.

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:52.600
I activate Masshu Macu's Monster Effect!

00:04:53.140 --> 00:04:59.070
When a Monster's Attack Power is changed, I can detach one Overlay Unit

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:02.110
and this card damages my opponent based on the difference.

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:04.820
Go, Masshu Macu!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.910
Infinity Cannon!

00:05:10.870 --> 00:05:14.040
The loser's Life is now a candle light flickering in the wind.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:17.920
And you're next, Kaito!

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:20.340
Do it, III!

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.760
Masshu Macu, attack Galaxy-Eyes!

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:25.340
Fire of Vril!

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:39.730
Thanks to the effect of Stonehenge Shield, Galaxy-Eye's Attack Power is zero!

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.820
This ends it, Kaito!

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:44.070
Kaito!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.570
Trap, activate! Battle Simulation!

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:54.540
When two Monsters battle, this card halves both Monsters' Attack Points,

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:57.830
and protects the Monsters from being destroyed in battle!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.750
But you'll still take battle damage!

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:07.050
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:06:09.930 --> 00:06:11.430
Kaito!

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:15.600
Kaito!

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:17.270
You okay?

00:06:17.270 --> 00:06:18.440
Hey!

00:06:19.400 --> 00:06:20.100
Kaito...

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.480
It's not over...

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:24.320
I still have Life left!

00:06:25.400 --> 00:06:27.110
What useless struggling.

00:06:27.110 --> 00:06:30.700
You should obediently fall into Hell like your brother!

00:06:32.700 --> 00:06:33.830
You bastard...!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:34.540
Kaito!

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:35.700
Calm down!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.080
Shut up!

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:42.500
How could you possibly understand my suffering... my sadness?!

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:47.590
Yeah, I can't.

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:52.680
I have no clue about you and Haruto's pain!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.470
But I Dueled you!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.560
I Dueled against you and understood you!

00:07:00.350 --> 00:07:04.270
Dueling allows one to make new friends and forge new bonds.

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:10.320
And Dueling lets one change themselves and bring it on a whole new level!

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:13.530
Dueling isn't a tool for one to smash their grudges and hatred against each other!

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:16.660
I'll show you how I bring it!

00:07:17.160 --> 00:07:19.710
Everything lies on this one draw.

00:07:19.710 --> 00:07:21.290
Go, Yuma!

00:07:21.790 --> 00:07:22.880
Right!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:25.210
My turn! Draw!

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:27.210
It's here!

00:07:27.210 --> 00:07:30.340
I activate the Magic Card Resurrection of the Dead!

00:07:31.300 --> 00:07:33.840
Revive, Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:07:35.640 --> 00:07:37.640
He brought back his Number.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.730
Hope's power won't end there!

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:43.190
This is how I bring it to ya!

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.520
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:51.280
Show yourself, Chaos Number 39!

00:07:53.240 --> 00:07:55.700
Aspiring Emperor - Hope Ray!

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.250
That's...!

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:10.170
Chaos Number, he said?!

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.630
What is that Number?!

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:17.850
This boy... Yuma Tsukumo...

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.640
Tsukumo...?

00:08:22.640 --> 00:08:23.560
Could it be...?

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:28.690
That's Yuma's light of hope!

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:32.110
See that? It's Hope's true form!

00:08:32.650 --> 00:08:35.030
I've never seen this Number before...

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:42.580
How can... this loser have a card like that?

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:45.790
I activate Hope Ray's Monster Effect!

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:52.010
By detaching one Overlay Unit, I can increase this card's Attack Power by 500 points!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.720
Overlay Charge!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:02.730
Yuma, he's already used all of Masshu Macu's Overlay Units.

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:09.820
But if he uses the effect of Giant Killer, who still has Overlay Units attached,

00:09:09.820 --> 00:09:12.070
we're done for.

00:09:12.490 --> 00:09:13.490
I know that!

00:09:13.490 --> 00:09:18.490
Then I decrease the Attack Power of an opposing Monster by 1000 points!

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:21.200
I select Giant Killer!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.910
Go, Hope Ray!

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:26.870
Hope Sword Chaos Slash!

00:09:41.470 --> 00:09:43.470
IV has 2400 Life left.

00:09:43.470 --> 00:09:44.890
With this attack...

00:09:44.890 --> 00:09:46.440
We beat IV!

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:49.150
He did it! Great job!

00:09:56.860 --> 00:09:59.910
The Permanent Tram, Gimmick Box.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:00.660
What?!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:08.000
When a player is to take battle damage, this card negates that damage,

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.750
and is then Special Summoned as a Monster.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:15.460
And this card's Attack Power becomes equal to the amount of negated damage!

00:10:15.460 --> 00:10:16.590
No way...!

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:19.220
Even Hope Ray couldn't stop him?

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:22.390
He read through our attack?

00:10:23.680 --> 00:10:27.100
I set a card face-down and end my turn!

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:31.400
And Hope Ray's Attack Power returns to normal.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:35.230
You honestly thought you could defeat <i>me</i>?!

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:38.490
Let me show you what <i>true despair</i> looks like!

00:10:38.490 --> 00:10:40.740
My turn! Draw!

00:10:41.240 --> 00:10:44.370
I activate the Magic Card Junk Puppet!

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:51.920
This card Special Summons a Gimmick Puppet Monster from my Graveyard with 1000 or less Attack Points in Defense Mode!

00:10:52.710 --> 00:10:56.210
Revive, Gimmick Puppet - Necro Doll!

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:13.110
I Overlay the Level Eight Gimmick Box and Necro Doll!

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:18.610
I build the Overlay Network with these two Dark Attribute Monsters!

00:11:18.610 --> 00:11:20.110
Xyz Summon!

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:24.580
Show yourself, Number 40!

00:11:33.580 --> 00:11:36.960
Gimmick Puppet - Heaven's Strings!

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:39.550
What?!

00:11:39.550 --> 00:11:43.550
No way! A 3000 Attack Power Number!

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.350
Time to wrap up my fanservice.

00:11:46.350 --> 00:11:50.310
Kaito, I'll send you to Hell alone first!

00:11:52.270 --> 00:11:55.610
Heaven's Strings! Attack Galaxy-Eyes!

00:11:56.070 --> 00:11:57.440
Heaven's Blade!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:03.240
<i>At this rate, Kaito will...!</i>

00:12:04.410 --> 00:12:05.320
<i>Haruto...</i>

00:12:07.080 --> 00:12:09.870
It's finished this time for sure, Kaito!

00:12:12.870 --> 00:12:16.380
Trap, activate! Trap Reborn!

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:25.140
This card halves my Life and lets me Banish a Trap Card in my opponent's Graveyard, gaining its effect!

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:28.640
I choose Battle Simulation!

00:12:30.720 --> 00:12:37.190
Battle Simulation negates a battle between two Monsters,

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:39.730
and negates the Monsters' destruction!

00:12:52.710 --> 00:12:53.750
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.130
Again?! Will you guys cut the bullshit already?!

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:04.050
Just die already!

00:13:04.050 --> 00:13:05.130
Just die!

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:08.010
<i>Yuma...</i>

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:11.270
<i>You reduced your own Life again...</i>

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:16.730
<i>Wasting my fanservice is unforgivable...!</i>

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.400
I won't forgive you guys!

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:22.990
I activate Heaven's Strings effect!

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:27.530
This card can detach an Overlay Unit once per turn

00:13:27.530 --> 00:13:32.040
At the end of the next turn, all Monsters on the field will be destroyed!

00:13:32.620 --> 00:13:38.750
And the Attack Power of the destroyed Monster will be dealt to the player as damage!

00:13:39.340 --> 00:13:40.340
What did you say?!

00:13:44.470 --> 00:13:48.640
This is the lineage of those fated to control the power of the gods!

00:14:05.780 --> 00:14:08.160
This is the absolute finale!

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:10.990
Now! It's your turns!

00:14:11.450 --> 00:14:18.040
Now if we don't defeat them by the end of Kaito's next turn, we have no chance of winning.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:22.630
Kaito...

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:28.720
What the heck? Out of strength already?

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:31.970
Guess we win if you can't even stand up.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:35.640
Kaito...

00:14:40.310 --> 00:14:43.860
Stand! Stand up, Kaito!

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:46.610
Are you okay losing like this?

00:14:47.530 --> 00:14:48.700
Stand!

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:51.320
Why aren't you standing?!

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.240
Kaito!!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.120
He's right! Stand, Kaito!

00:14:59.120 --> 00:15:00.080
Stand up!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:00.670
Eh?

00:15:00.670 --> 00:15:02.420
Stand up and fight!

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.920
Please stand up, Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:09.300
It's fine if you're a mess. Just don't give up until the very end!

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:12.680
You can't just give up like this!

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:16.640
If you don't protect Haruto...

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:21.440
....who else is gonna protect Haruto!?

00:15:22.100 --> 00:15:22.940
Haruto...

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:24.820
I've let you get hurt again...

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:32.490
<i>Brother! Brother!!</i>

00:15:32.490 --> 00:15:33.240
<i>Haruto!</i>

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:35.620
<i>Haruto!!</i>

00:15:40.040 --> 00:15:41.460
<i>Kaito.</i>

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:48.710
<i>If you want to see Haruto, you have no choice but to work for Dr. Faker-</i>sama<i>.</i>

00:15:48.710 --> 00:15:51.720
<i>Get along with him well, Kaito.</i>

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.720
<i>You bastard!</i>

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:26.340
I swear to... protect you at all costs!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:32.970
Haruto!!

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:40.220
<i>I'll take all the memories you siblings share.</i>

00:16:40.220 --> 00:16:42.100
<i>I won't let you.</i>

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:42.980
<i>Huh?</i>

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.770
<i>I won't hand the memories I share with my brother to anyone.</i>

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.110
<i>Haruto!</i>

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:48.690
<i>Why are you here?</i>

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:53.400
What the...?

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:54.990
What's happening?

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:57.450
<i>You couldn't possibly understand.</i>

00:16:57.450 --> 00:17:00.580
<i>Not how hard my brother tries to protect me!</i>

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:04.160
<i>Not how he's shielded me for so long!</i>

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:08.380
<i>This time I'll protect my brother!</i>

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:19.180
What the hell?!

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:20.850
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:30.610
What?!

00:17:31.230 --> 00:17:32.860
This is...

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:40.910
What's happening?

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:49.880
Why...?

00:17:50.460 --> 00:17:52.840
Haruto's power disappeared...

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:58.090
Haruto... You gave me this power, didn't you?

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:10.060
A new power has just awakened with the Kaito deck!

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:12.730
A new power?

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.940
This is the bond between siblings.

00:18:14.940 --> 00:18:16.650
It's created a miracle!

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:19.110
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:20.870
My turn!

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:22.740
Draw!!

00:18:23.620 --> 00:18:26.040
Galaxy-Eyes' Attack Power is zero!

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:28.790
Your Life is a mere 100!

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:32.500
What can someone with one foot in the grave possibly do!?

00:18:32.500 --> 00:18:34.880
You're the only dieing ones here!

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:43.760
I activate the Magic Card, Overlay Regenerate, from my hand!

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:52.230
This card revives Overlay Units equal to the number of Xyz Monsters on the field!

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:03.490
Astral, are you there?!

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:08.830
You told me that I me and Yuma were similar.

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:10.920
If that's the case, resonate with me!

00:19:11.790 --> 00:19:15.130
Yuma, let's use our Monster to help Kaito!

00:19:15.840 --> 00:19:16.800
Right!

00:19:17.420 --> 00:19:19.720
Kaito, use my Monsters!

00:19:19.720 --> 00:19:21.300
Go!

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:27.220
I release Hope Ray and Damage Release...

00:19:27.220 --> 00:19:29.560
...to Advance Summon Photon Kaiser!

00:19:30.890 --> 00:19:35.190
When Photon Kaiser is used as Xyz Material, it can be counted twice!

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:42.530
I Overlay the Level Eight Galaxy-Eyes and the two Photon Kaisers!

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:50.500
I build the Overlay Network with these three Monsters!

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:52.870
Xyz Summon!

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:54.880
Surging silver energy!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:00.470
Become the rolling waves and show your mighty form!

00:20:06.640 --> 00:20:09.930
Descend, my very soul!

00:20:24.780 --> 00:20:28.030
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.040
Galaxy-Eyes just evolved!

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:37.790
This is what I felt...

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:40.380
Kaito's new power!

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:43.880
Go! I activate Neo Galaxy-Eyes' Monster Effect!

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:46.720
Photon Howling!

00:20:50.430 --> 00:20:54.270
When Neo Galaxy-Eyes is Summoned using Galaxy-Eyes,

00:20:54.270 --> 00:20:57.110
it negates the effects of all other Monsters on the field!

00:20:57.650 --> 00:20:58.270
What?

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:02.740
It can activate its effect without removing Overlay Units?

00:21:03.610 --> 00:21:06.950
I activate Neo Galaxy-Eyes' second effect!

00:21:07.320 --> 00:21:12.500
By detaching one Overlay Unit, it takes away all other Overlay Units on the field!

00:21:13.330 --> 00:21:19.000
It then gains 500 Attack Points for each Overlay Unit taken during this turn,

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:20.800
and can attack repeatedly for each!

00:21:21.460 --> 00:21:23.010
6000 Attack Points!

00:21:23.010 --> 00:21:25.260
And it's got consecutive attacks?!

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:27.840
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:21:27.840 --> 00:21:31.180
Ultimate Photon Stream!!

00:21:46.280 --> 00:21:47.700
III!!

00:21:49.490 --> 00:21:52.330
IV, are you ready for your punishment?!

00:21:55.080 --> 00:21:57.960
Ultimate Photon Stream!!

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:22.860
<i>Someone gave me some water.</i>

00:22:23.230 --> 00:22:28.780
<i>So I was able to paint a rainbow with ease.</i>

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>I want to become someone perfect.</i>

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:37.750
<i>But it's very difficult.</i>

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:41.330
<i>Even with me suffering,</i>

00:22:41.460 --> 00:22:45.420
<i>I can't seem to grasp victory.</i>

00:22:46.300 --> 00:22:48.220
<i>I want to bloom!</i>

00:22:48.760 --> 00:22:52.680
<i>I must be having some kind of weird dream.</i>

00:22:52.680 --> 00:22:55.720
<i>But If I must fulfill this,</i>

00:22:56.220 --> 00:22:59.020
<i>Then I don't mind being laughed at for it.</i>

00:22:59.190 --> 00:23:06.110
<i>Since it's because your limits are decided on your own.</i>

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:09.150
<i>I'll show it, overcoming it to tomorrow.</i>

00:23:09.400 --> 00:23:13.620
<i>Ah, I'm aiming for the big blue sky.</i>

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:15.580
<i>For all of its glory.</i>

00:23:15.580 --> 00:23:17.370
<i>The Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:19.120 --> 00:23:22.750
<i>All of those countless flower petals</i>

00:23:22.960 --> 00:23:25.800
<i>They came at the expense of</i>

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:29.380
<i>me being able to reach those heights.</i>

00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:33.800
<i>Ah, even though I lost my way today,</i>

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:35.640
<i>I still yearn for it.</i>

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.930
<i>That Freesia of Desire.</i>

00:23:39.940 --> 00:23:43.810
After the fight ended, V suddenly appeared before us.

00:23:43.810 --> 00:23:47.820
I then learned the truth that someone dear to me who was supposed to have disappeared...

00:23:47.820 --> 00:23:50.200
What the heck is going on here?!

00:23:50.200 --> 00:23:51.990
Yuma, do you think he really...?!

00:23:51.990 --> 00:23:53.910
Grandpa R-Rokujuro!

00:23:53.910 --> 00:23:56.490
You're saying you don't care about the Numbers?

00:23:56.490 --> 00:23:59.330
Do I choose Astral or Haruto?

00:23:59.330 --> 00:24:02.420
There's no way I can decide that!

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:04.670
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:04.670 --> 00:24:07.460
"The Forked Paths of Destiny! Yuma Abandons Dueling"

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:09.170
I'm gonna bring it to 'em!
